Square Packing Archive
Copyright 2026 Square Packing Archive contributors

This project builds on decades of work by the square-packing community. The
historical catalog is initially derived from Erich Friedman's “Packing Unit
Squares in Squares” survey and public tracker, and from David Ellsworth's
high-precision SVG reconstruction and continuing record tracker. Every claim
keeps its own provenance and credits the discoverers, optimizers, and proof
authors represented by its source material.

No third-party paper, website, or SVG is relicensed by this repository. The
archive stores bibliographic facts, independently normalized data, and original
renderings. See ATTRIBUTION.md for source-specific acknowledgements.
